ND a minimum dispute count. The ratio alone would flag most of the portfolio; both together flag one merchant. Thresholds are read from secondary sources, not the scheme rulebooks, and the window is this dataset's span, not a calendar month.","ratio_only":71,"suppressed_examples":[{"captures":43,"disputes":3,"merchant_id":"MID100019","ratio_pct":"6.98"},{"captures":45,"disputes":3,"merchant_id":"MID100045","ratio_pct":"6.67"},{"captures":46,"disputes":3,"merchant_id":"MID100008","ratio_pct":"6.52"}],"thresholds":{"min_disputes":100,"ratio_pct":"1.50"},"window":["2026-02-12","2026-03-03"],"window_days":20},"fabric":{"capacity":"Fabric trial FTL64, UAE North","dbt_build_WH_MIZAN":{"error":0,"note":"Full parity with the local DuckDB target for the first time; the 2026-11-14 run predated three models and stood at 65.","pass":91,"skip":0,"warn":0},"gold_checks_WH_MIZAN":{"dim_party_golden":{"max_member_count":5,"rows":2552},"fact_merchant_dispute_monitor":{"breaches_ratio_only":71,"in_monitoring_programme":1,"merchants":121},"fact_merchant_settlement_recon":{"bank_paid_sar":"19503614.17","gross_captures_sar":"22391236.23","in_transit_sar":"1125209.07","rows":2233,"sum_abs_bank_variance_sar":"0.00","sum_abs_gl_variance_sar":"0.00"},"fact_zatca_clearance_ledger":{"CLEARED":1087,"CONFIRMED_REJECTION":1,"REPORTED":23913,"rows":25001},"mart_ndmo_scorecard":{"ACCURACY":"100.00","COMPLETENESS":"100.00","CONSISTENCY":"100.00","TIMELINESS":"94.44","UNIQUENESS":"100.00","VALIDITY":"100.00"},"queried_over":"the WH_MIZAN SQL endpoint with the service principal, after the dbt build"},"known_platform_behaviour":{"lakehouse_sql_endpoint_lag":"After the ZATCA step rewrote slv.zatca_invoice_documents, the first dbt build still failed on the pre-rewrite snapshot: the Lakehouse SQL analytics endpoint syncs asynchronously behind the Delta tables. The identical build a minute later passed 91/91. Worth knowing before trusting a dbt result taken immediately after a Spark write."},"lakehouse_checks_LH_MIZAN":{"brz.zatca_invoices_raw":{"distinct_request_id":25000,"note":"Two versions of every request: the original and the price-corrected re-send. Bronze is append-only by design; Silver takes the latest.","rows":50000},"ctl.invoice_outbox":{"distinct_invoice_uuid":25001,"rows":25001},"slv.zatca_invoice_documents":{"distinct_invoice_uuid":25001,"rows":25001}},"note":"Re-run of the 2026-11-14 deployment after six item prices were corrected locally. Bronze is append-only, so every source file re-landed as corrections rather than duplicates: the landed_rows below are the rows whose payload actually changed, not the file sizes. This run also exposed a real defect -- see zatca_chain.defect_found.","notebook_jobs":{"ai_index":{"case_note_chunks":1552,"policy_chunks":11,"seconds":61,"status":"Completed"},"bronze_land":{"files_sha_match":"all","landed_as_corrections":{"commerce_events":7981,"erp_gl":7803,"payment_events":4692,"settlement_total":4650,"zatca_requests":25000},"resend":"ALL_DUPLICATE","seconds":714,"status":"Completed","unchanged_all_duplicate":["crm_pos_cp1256.csv","crm_ecom_utf8.csv","spl_address_observations.csv","NAJDACQ_SETTLEMENT_20260220_RESEND.csv"]},"mdm_resolve":{"address_observations":1000,"addresses_unresolved":2,"anchored_records":3616,"goldens":2552,"idless_attached":248,"open_conflicts":1,"records":3985,"seconds":82,"status":"Completed"},"ndmo_catalog":{"columns":350,"over_classified_columns":276,"seconds":61,"secret_or_higher_tables":9,"status":"Completed","tables":27},"silver_build":{"seconds":163,"status":"Completed"},"zatca_chain":{"defect_found":"The first run of this step on corrected data doubled slv.zatca_invoice_documents to 50,002 rows: zatca_land joined ctl.invoice_outbox to brz.zatca_invoices_raw on request_id, and Bronze held two versions of every request, so each outbox row fanned into two. dbt's source_unique test caught it (25,001 duplicate invoice_uuid) and refused to publish Gold. Fixed by reading Bronze through _latest(